{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11211840","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211840","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1121183001:":{"text":"可憎的恶魔，现身吧！","source_cn":"可憎的恶魔，现身吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC082F4E2D4AC6F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1121183002:":{"text":"肮脏！污秽！丑恶！扭曲！","source_cn":"肮脏！污秽！丑恶！扭曲！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0497A6DB40D53E1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1121183003:":{"text":"破坏艺术的暴徒！","source_cn":"破坏艺术的暴徒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60B4DBB451EFFFDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121184001:1":{"text":"丑恶的神明造物，在我的精心加工下，才勉强呈现出了对称与均衡之美！","source_cn":"丑恶的神明造物，在我的精心加工下，才勉强呈现出了对称与...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA49D1EA82D79B602","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121184002:1":{"text":"我呕心沥血弥补的美学漏洞，居然被审美低贱的异物破坏了——不可饶恕，无法饶恕！","source_cn":"我呕心沥血弥补的美学漏洞，居然被审美低贱的异物破坏了—...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8032C836312CDC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"